Most merchants in the region still wait two or three days for card money. That gap is paid for by someone, usually the merchant''s own working capital.

Three things we have learned running same-day settlement:
1. Speed is only useful when the payout carries the data finance needs to reconcile it.
2. Exceptions, not volumes, decide how many people operations needs.
3. Limits and holds have to be designed before launch, not after the first incident.

